  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0 (breaking): unified backend convention: InMemoryBackend.Create/CreateAsync(InMemoryRepositorySettings) replaces the constructors (Capabilities, JsonOptions on the settings); Store replaced by the typed Backend property; the backend is IDisposable/IAsyncDisposable (disposing discards data); typed BeginTransactionAsync; Clear/ClearAsync (per type returns the row count); evaluator moved to core QueryEvaluator<TRow>; Native AOT verified. See CHANGELOG.md.",
